  "name": "Naming bench (µBench)",
  "method": "180 pictures (leucocytes, Pap cytology) in the eyepiece disc x 4 conditions (told the right specimen, nothing, the wrong one, and a blank grey disc told the specimen), through a click (identify) and the running look (sight). Compared on the 171 pictures every option answered: exact names over the three told conditions, the right kind, ECE when told the right specimen, median time, and blank discs named over every grey answer.",
  "code": "services/bench/naming",
  "command": "python -m bench.naming.run",
  "cases": 180,
  "repeats": 1,
  "inputs": {
